('ab645c82-6fb3-441a-a747-df06d2113dba', 'life_science', 'year_8', 'proficient', 'multiple_choice', 'A characteristic that appears due to a change in an organism''s DNA is called a:', '["Habitat","Mutation","Adaptation only","Ecosystem"]'::jsonb, 1, 'A mutation is a change in an organism''s DNA, which can sometimes lead to new traits.', 'AC9S8U02', null, null, true, null, null, null, null),
