How much does he save in the fifth week?', null, null, 'His savings go $6, $10, $14, $18 and $22, so he saves $22 in the fifth week.', 'AC9M6A01', null, null, true, '$22', ARRAY['22']::text[], null, null),
('e87b93bc-49fb-4ccd-b165-70e4437f9fcf', 'number_patterns', 'grade_6', 'advanced', 'multiple_choice', 'Aroha buys 4 packs of stickers and gets 3 free stickers.
