('5647037e-38eb-4045-b1e1-5e4b84eecd73', 'geometry_measurement', 'grade_6', 'developing', 'multiple_choice', 'How long is the key?', '["5.4 cm","5.6 cm","6.4 cm","54 cm"]'::jsonb, 0, 'The key starts at 1 cm and ends at 6.4 cm, so it is 6.4 − 1 = 5.4 cm long. Reading only the end of the key gives 6.4 cm.', 'AC9M6M01', null, null, true, null, null, null, null),
('de19112a-ca3c-4d68-8ee8-af3a26404521', 'geometry_measurement', 'grade_6', 'proficient', 'multiple_choice', 'Use the bus timetable.
