('9bfddcb3-5ab2-436f-a0e8-c4c49fee5e95', 'geometry_measurement', 'grade_6', 'proficient', 'multiple_choice', 'Triangle A is moved 5 units to the right and 2 units down.
Which triangle shows where it ends up?', '["P","Q","R","S"]'::jsonb, 1, 'The corner at (−4, 2) moves 5 right to 1 and 2 down to 0, landing at (1, 0). That is triangle Q. Triangle P moved up instead of down, and R is a reflection, not a slide.', 'AC9M6SP03', null, null, true, null, null, null, null),
('6ab1aa6e-0c57-4c25-b34b-a6a910bb41f4', 'geometry_measurement', 'grade_6', 'developing', 'multiple_choice', 'The jug shows how much juice is left.
