('145073c0-925a-4a90-8f74-499ef51eecdc', 'number_operations', 'grade_3', 'proficient', 'multiple_choice', 'In the number 4827, what is the value of the digit 8?', '["8000","800","80","8"]'::jsonb, 1, 'The 8 is in the hundreds place, so it is worth 800. The 4 is in the thousands place.', 'AC9M3N01', null, null, true, null, null, null, null),
('99dcee21-8912-4a20-8c89-5108a33ae0a8', 'number_patterns', 'grade_3', 'proficient', 'short_answer', 'Kai makes this pattern with tiles.
