('82ff05f0-e9b6-473b-8974-b9388ba42b5b', 'geometry_measurement', 'grade_3', 'developing', 'multiple_choice', 'Which angle is smaller than a right angle?', '["","","",""]'::jsonb, 3, 'A right angle is a square corner, like angle B. Angle D is narrower than a square corner, so it is smaller. Angles A and C are larger.', 'AC9M3M05', null, null, true, null, null, null, null),
