('aa078bf3-3d58-4e80-9cb3-813196f18e8b', 'statistics_probability', 'grade_3', 'proficient', 'multiple_choice', 'Which spinner is most likely to land on black?', '["","","",""]'::jsonb, 1, 'Spinner B is black on 3 of its 4 equal parts, more than any other spinner. Spinner C is black on half, and A and D on less than half.', 'AC9M3P01', null, null, true, null, null, null, null),
('ac6aae66-42bd-4129-9b6c-f5728e0f912b', 'statistics_probability', 'grade_3', 'proficient', 'multiple_choice', 'The diagram shows which students in Class 3B play soccer and which play tennis.
